WEBVTT

00:13.805 --> 00:15.807
We finally found them!

00:15.890 --> 00:17.559
This is Star Platinum!

00:17.642 --> 00:19.394
Jolyne Cujoh.

00:19.477 --> 00:24.024
Did she defeat the guard
by herself and take the discs?

00:29.571 --> 00:31.990
I will return the disc to my father.

00:32.824 --> 00:35.285
Along with the disc held by Pale Snake…

00:35.869 --> 00:36.953
No matter what.

00:38.830 --> 00:39.914
Of course.

00:39.998 --> 00:45.003
All memories relating to myself
have been deleted from Miraschon's disc.

00:45.670 --> 00:48.506
Therefore, no one
will be able to track it to me.

00:49.007 --> 00:51.509
The difference between humans and animals,

00:51.593 --> 00:56.056
is that humans seek heaven.

00:56.765 --> 01:00.477
Humans ought to lead a life
that leads them to heaven.

01:01.102 --> 01:05.023
This is what makes humans beautiful.

02:38.283 --> 02:39.409
EPISODE 10: OPERATION SAVAGE GUARDIAN
(HEAD TO THE COURTYARD!), PART 1

02:39.492 --> 02:40.952
-Soap.
-Here's my rent.

02:41.035 --> 02:43.454
I want the most expensive watch you got.

02:44.330 --> 02:45.165
Move.

02:46.541 --> 02:48.334
I'm using the phone next.

02:48.418 --> 02:49.711
What?

02:49.794 --> 02:52.630
Are you crazy, bitch?
I'll take real good care of--

02:57.218 --> 03:00.346
Take a seat! You won't get tired!

03:03.099 --> 03:05.602
Here's a complimentary drink.

03:06.186 --> 03:08.396
Feel free to ask me again.

03:20.241 --> 03:24.078
This is The Speedwagon Foundation HQ
in Dallas, Texas.

03:24.579 --> 03:27.749
We do not accept
collect calls on this number.

03:27.832 --> 03:31.211
I looked up the number in a phonebook.
I only have this number.

03:32.045 --> 03:33.588
And I'm an inmate

03:33.671 --> 03:36.716
at the Green Dolphin Street
State Prison in Florida.

03:37.300 --> 03:39.093
My name is Jolyne Cujoh.

03:39.677 --> 03:41.930
Please connect me to someone
who knows what this means.

03:43.264 --> 03:44.390
Please hold.

03:49.020 --> 03:50.480
Thank you for waiting.

03:51.314 --> 03:54.108
Are you Professor Jotaro Kujo's daughter?

03:54.192 --> 03:55.026
And you are?

03:55.610 --> 03:57.695
I am just a foundation representative.

03:58.196 --> 04:00.907
And I am not a Stand User.

04:00.990 --> 04:01.908
I see.

04:02.408 --> 04:04.661
But you seem to know
about Stand abilities.

04:04.744 --> 04:07.372
Do you know about the discs?

04:07.455 --> 04:08.957
Yes, of course.

04:09.582 --> 04:13.795
After retrieving
Dr. Jotaro Kujo's body from the UUV,

04:13.878 --> 04:16.839
he has been sheltered, not here in Dallas,

04:16.923 --> 04:19.509
but somewhere safe.

04:21.135 --> 04:24.138
I am so sorry to inform you of this,

04:24.639 --> 04:28.518
but your father is medically unresponsive.

04:29.602 --> 04:33.356
If I say that we can bring him
back to life, will you believe me?

04:33.940 --> 04:36.818
I am merely a scientist. I cannot comment.

04:37.318 --> 04:38.861
I have obtained a disc.

04:38.945 --> 04:40.113
Just one of them.

04:40.196 --> 04:41.739
We can bring him back.

04:41.823 --> 04:44.742
I just know that
the discs will bring him back.

04:45.910 --> 04:48.871
I'll do whatever it takes
to deliver them to you.

04:48.955 --> 04:50.915
I just don't know how to do it.

04:51.499 --> 04:55.712
I want you to come up
with a plan to deliver the discs there.

04:55.795 --> 04:56.838
Immediately.

04:57.547 --> 05:00.675
Isn't this conversation
being recorded by the prison?

05:01.843 --> 05:03.803
Yes, probably.

05:03.886 --> 05:06.347
But that's a risk I'm willing to take.

05:06.431 --> 05:07.807
I have no time.

05:07.890 --> 05:09.767
This is urgent.

05:10.560 --> 05:14.355
I'm in a dangerous situation
where I cannot hide the disc anywhere.

05:15.898 --> 05:17.900
There must be a way.

05:17.984 --> 05:21.529
And just so you know,
I am not allowed visitors.

05:21.612 --> 05:22.530
I understand.

05:22.613 --> 05:24.574
Since you insist…

05:26.034 --> 05:27.452
What about the courtyard?

05:27.535 --> 05:28.661
The courtyard?

05:29.454 --> 05:32.832
Do you mean the courtyard
between the men's and women's prisons?

05:32.915 --> 05:33.958
Yes.

05:34.042 --> 05:36.044
Please be there in 20 minutes.

05:36.627 --> 05:38.254
I can manage something.

05:38.338 --> 05:40.757
In 20 minutes?

05:40.840 --> 05:41.799
From now?

05:42.508 --> 05:44.260
Yes. You said this is urgent.

05:45.136 --> 05:49.223
If you instruct us to retrieve the discs,
we will do everything we can to do so.

05:49.307 --> 05:52.143
If you say he will be revived,
we believe you.

05:52.727 --> 05:53.561
However,

05:54.145 --> 05:57.732
we are a non-militaristic
medical research foundation.

05:57.815 --> 05:59.484
We neither have the resources

05:59.567 --> 06:03.488
nor the ability to help you escape
or save your life.

06:04.238 --> 06:06.783
Is that risk acceptable to you?

06:07.367 --> 06:09.285
Okay. I'll be there.

06:09.869 --> 06:12.580
And how will you retrieve the disc?

06:12.663 --> 06:15.249
We shouldn't speak of that over the phone.

06:15.833 --> 06:19.212
But please look for Savage Guardian.

06:19.295 --> 06:20.963
You will understand then.

06:21.798 --> 06:25.510
Let's call it
Operation Savage Guardian for now.

06:29.764 --> 06:31.391
Savage Guardian…

06:31.474 --> 06:33.101
Is that an object?

06:33.184 --> 06:34.644
Or is it a person?

06:35.228 --> 06:36.521
Fine.

06:36.604 --> 06:38.356
I need to head to the courtyard.

06:39.107 --> 06:41.234
I'm at the cafeteria
of the women's prison.

06:41.317 --> 06:45.196
To get to the courtyard,
first, I must pass through the gate,

06:45.279 --> 06:47.031
go up the stairs in the back,

06:47.615 --> 06:49.242
cross the second floor corridor

06:49.325 --> 06:52.245
to get to the medical wing
from the women's prison.

06:52.328 --> 06:53.704
You may pass.

06:54.872 --> 06:59.794
FE40536, you're the nuisance
who got sent to the Punishment Ward.

06:59.877 --> 07:03.464
Your access to different parts
of the facility is restricted.

07:14.392 --> 07:15.226
Jolyne.

07:15.726 --> 07:16.602
Emporio!

07:16.686 --> 07:19.188
Here! Do not touch the ball.

07:25.611 --> 07:27.488
We can't let others see us.

07:28.072 --> 07:28.906
Come with me.

07:37.415 --> 07:38.291
Wha…

07:45.756 --> 07:48.009
Emporio, those two…

07:48.634 --> 07:50.678
It's fine, they can be trusted.

07:51.262 --> 07:53.639
He prefers to sleep on a bed,

07:53.723 --> 07:55.975
but this room doesn't have one.

07:56.058 --> 07:59.020
So he ends up sleeping in the piano.

08:06.652 --> 08:11.782
Jolyne, I live in secret
in this ghost of a room.

08:11.866 --> 08:13.326
Ghost of a room?

08:13.409 --> 08:15.870
Does that mean you're…

08:15.953 --> 08:17.163
No, Jolyne.

08:17.747 --> 08:19.624
He and I are alive.

08:19.707 --> 08:21.209
We aren't ghosts.

08:21.292 --> 08:23.878
You can touch us.
We're warm and have pulses.

08:24.504 --> 08:25.546
Listen closely.

08:26.172 --> 08:30.510
Ghosts do not live here,
but the building itself is a ghost.

08:32.428 --> 08:33.554
What?

08:33.638 --> 08:35.640
Does "the ghost of objects" make sense?

08:36.224 --> 08:41.145
This prison caught fire in 1984
and went through a huge renovation.

08:41.229 --> 08:43.981
This room burned down in that fire.

08:45.191 --> 08:47.485
This room belongs in the past.

08:47.568 --> 08:49.278
It's a ghost of the music room.

08:50.571 --> 08:54.116
So… this means… Emporio,

08:54.617 --> 08:55.451
are you…

08:56.160 --> 08:57.495
Ever since I was born,

08:57.578 --> 09:00.331
I've been able to materialize
the ghosts of objects.

09:01.040 --> 09:03.042
That's my Stand ability.

09:03.876 --> 09:06.254
But I can only use them.

09:07.046 --> 09:10.216
So even this chocolate bar
and this orange juice…

09:13.678 --> 09:15.721
I can't consume them.

09:15.805 --> 09:18.474
But they still have a taste.
They're quite good.

09:23.688 --> 09:24.522
What?

09:25.064 --> 09:26.065
Don't worry.

09:26.148 --> 09:29.652
This clock stopped
when it burned along with the room.

09:30.403 --> 09:33.281
You still have time
before your 20 minutes are up.

09:33.364 --> 09:34.448
But…

09:35.825 --> 09:38.828
you made a plan to deliver the disc
over the phone.

09:38.911 --> 09:40.121
How reckless!

09:40.788 --> 09:43.374
I understand your situation.

09:43.457 --> 09:46.168
Pale Snake will learn about this.

09:47.295 --> 09:48.629
Please, Emporio.

09:48.713 --> 09:51.173
Tell me how I can reach the courtyard.

09:51.257 --> 09:52.842
Don't misunderstand me.

09:52.925 --> 09:56.846
I can't access just any place
from this ghost room.

09:56.929 --> 10:00.641
I use the ghost items like this

10:00.725 --> 10:03.561
to get around without getting caught.

10:04.437 --> 10:06.564
I know you have no choice.

10:07.148 --> 10:08.816
He says he wants to tag along.

10:10.901 --> 10:12.486
You should take him.

10:12.570 --> 10:13.779
He can aid your cause.

10:14.322 --> 10:17.950
His name is Weather Forecast.

10:23.623 --> 10:26.125
This is a music room.

10:28.127 --> 10:30.588
Don't be so alarmed.

10:31.088 --> 10:34.717
Weather doesn't talk much
because he has no memory.

10:34.800 --> 10:36.260
-Memory?
-Yes.

10:36.886 --> 10:40.890
He has no memory of his childhood
or when he arrived here.

10:42.016 --> 10:44.018
He's serving a six-year sentence.

10:44.602 --> 10:47.355
He has a habit of walking on tip-toes.

10:47.438 --> 10:49.732
He's a TV guide fanatic,
but he doesn't watch TV.

10:50.316 --> 10:52.777
When he talks, he barely opens his mouth.

10:52.860 --> 10:55.196
And he talks right up to your face,

10:55.279 --> 10:57.490
so you may feel his lukewarm breath.

10:58.074 --> 10:59.533
He has no memory?

10:59.617 --> 11:02.578
Is that because
Pale Snake stole them from him?

11:02.662 --> 11:03.579
Probably.

11:04.080 --> 11:06.874
He wants to learn about himself.

11:06.957 --> 11:12.171
He also wants to know
why Pale Snake wants your father's discs.

11:16.759 --> 11:21.722
He says his Stand ability
is not tied to the discs.

11:22.598 --> 11:24.725
He was born a Stand User.

11:25.393 --> 11:26.477
As for his ability…

11:30.356 --> 11:33.025
he can manipulate the weather to his will.

11:34.568 --> 11:35.820
His Stand name is…

11:38.989 --> 11:40.282
Weather Forecast.

12:00.386 --> 12:03.472
Pretend you didn't notice him.

12:07.059 --> 12:10.938
Someone was peeking to see
where the music was coming from.

12:12.523 --> 12:14.442
Now it's confirmed.

12:15.025 --> 12:17.278
Someone knows you made a move

12:17.945 --> 12:20.197
and came to check on you.

12:21.073 --> 12:23.492
And we now know his face.

12:30.082 --> 12:31.959
STAND NAME: JUMPIN' JACK SPARK
STAND MASTER: LANG RANGLER

12:44.722 --> 12:48.017
Dammit. He's already close.

12:48.100 --> 12:52.313
But if he's a Stand User,
we need to take care of him now!

12:52.396 --> 12:53.606
No, Jolyne.

12:53.689 --> 12:55.232
We should hide for now.

12:55.816 --> 12:59.361
He doesn't know that
you're headed for the courtyard.

12:59.945 --> 13:01.739
He didn't hear your phone call

13:01.822 --> 13:04.116
and that's why came to eavesdrop!

13:04.700 --> 13:08.245
If he knew, he would have
waited at the courtyard.

13:08.329 --> 13:10.831
That's why, right now,

13:10.915 --> 13:12.374
he's chasing us!

13:17.463 --> 13:18.464
What's up with him?

13:19.048 --> 13:22.384
Turn into that corner
before he gets any closer. Hurry!

13:41.237 --> 13:42.321
Just as I thought.

13:43.906 --> 13:45.699
He doesn't know

13:46.450 --> 13:49.745
where you're going yet.

13:49.829 --> 13:52.414
But what's with him?

13:52.498 --> 13:54.500
He had a weird way of running.

13:55.167 --> 13:58.587
We were able to hide because he's slow.

13:58.671 --> 14:02.341
Anyway, you need to head to the courtyard.

14:02.925 --> 14:05.970
Your phone call earlier
was definitely recorded,

14:06.053 --> 14:09.390
but I don't think Pale Snake heard it yet.

14:09.473 --> 14:12.101
The sooner you go,
the less dangerous it'll be.

14:12.601 --> 14:14.353
The medical wing is up ahead.

14:14.979 --> 14:17.398
Once you go downstairs
and pass the medical wing,

14:17.481 --> 14:19.275
there's a gate for the corridor.

14:19.775 --> 14:21.360
It leads to the factory.

14:21.443 --> 14:24.280
It also leads to the men's prison
across the courtyard.

14:24.363 --> 14:27.408
The medical wing is accessed
by both men and women.

14:27.491 --> 14:29.743
Weather Forecast is a man,

14:29.827 --> 14:32.037
so if tells a guard
he's going back to the men's prison,

14:32.121 --> 14:34.957
he'll have no problem
getting to the connecting corridor

14:35.040 --> 14:37.293
and getting to the factory entrance.

14:37.376 --> 14:38.210
Go on ahead.

14:39.336 --> 14:42.006
I need to bribe the guards, right?

14:42.673 --> 14:43.924
Is 50 dollars enough?

14:44.008 --> 14:47.219
Tell them you want your boots repaired
at the factory.

14:47.303 --> 14:49.763
But even if you manage
to pass the medical wing,

14:50.306 --> 14:54.184
you'll have to get to
the courtyard by force.

14:55.102 --> 14:58.063
The security is light,
but if you get caught, they'll shoot.

14:58.147 --> 15:01.066
and you'll get five more years
for trying to escape.

15:01.150 --> 15:03.110
By force, huh?

15:03.611 --> 15:05.529
Guess I have to get used to using it.

15:06.655 --> 15:07.948
I just have to go.

15:08.032 --> 15:12.453
Another five years
is nothing at this point.

15:12.536 --> 15:14.079
Thank you, Emporio.

15:14.163 --> 15:15.080
Right.

15:15.789 --> 15:17.207
This is the most I can do.

15:17.791 --> 15:19.168
Please revive him.

15:21.003 --> 15:23.047
If your father comes back to life,

15:23.130 --> 15:24.131
then I think

15:24.632 --> 15:28.677
I might be able see some hope.

15:35.601 --> 15:36.727
Oh, dammit.

15:36.810 --> 15:38.771
What's wrong with this cola?

15:38.854 --> 15:41.440
You touched the can, didn't you?

15:43.108 --> 15:45.527
Did you shake the can?

15:45.611 --> 15:47.655
Get me another one, will you?

15:47.738 --> 15:49.990
Oh, I didn't touch it.

15:50.074 --> 15:53.494
I only touched the plate.

15:55.245 --> 15:57.289
My shoe's got a hole on it.

15:57.373 --> 15:59.833
Over in the back. Can you see it?

15:59.917 --> 16:02.336
I wanted to get it repaired
at the factory.

16:05.172 --> 16:07.549
Oh, man, my cola spilled.

16:07.633 --> 16:09.885
Where did I put that washrag?

16:21.271 --> 16:22.773
"Go get a cola"?

16:22.856 --> 16:24.942
You really want me to get one?

16:26.819 --> 16:29.196
And you want me to pour it into this cup?

16:29.279 --> 16:32.032
Do that yourself why don't you…

16:48.382 --> 16:50.467
What's going on?

16:50.968 --> 16:53.012
Oh, here's the washrag.

16:53.512 --> 16:57.433
You can go. But make sure
to be back here in 20 minutes…

16:58.058 --> 17:00.060
Oh, she already left.

17:00.978 --> 17:02.813
What? Where's my cup and the plate?

17:03.981 --> 17:05.983
What's happening?

17:06.650 --> 17:07.526
Could it be…

17:11.530 --> 17:13.032
This is…

17:13.115 --> 17:15.701
The plate is floating!

17:15.784 --> 17:17.244
The cup and the boot as well.

17:17.327 --> 17:20.914
But, the contents of the cup
aren't spilling out.

17:20.998 --> 17:23.125
It turns into balls of liquid and floats!

17:23.208 --> 17:27.755
Everything I touch is floating upwards!

17:27.838 --> 17:31.717
That money must have floated out
of that guard's pocket!

17:31.800 --> 17:34.511
I'm in the air too.

17:34.595 --> 17:38.182
Since when that strange guy
started chasing me...?

17:38.766 --> 17:41.351
He spit at me then.

17:41.435 --> 17:42.561
Did that cause this?

17:43.353 --> 17:45.189
The disc!

17:46.023 --> 17:48.650
Dammit. It slipped out when I rotated!

17:48.734 --> 17:50.611
Stone Ocean!

17:51.612 --> 17:54.239
My thread! I can't control it!

17:54.323 --> 17:56.241
There is no up and down.

17:56.742 --> 17:58.744
There's no gravity!

17:58.827 --> 18:00.996
I'm in zero gravity!

18:01.080 --> 18:02.998
You're going back to the men's prison?

18:03.957 --> 18:06.251
Okay. Go ahead.

18:12.341 --> 18:14.468
This is bad! He'll take my disc!

18:14.551 --> 18:18.430
If I try to punch, I'll lose my balance.

18:18.514 --> 18:20.307
I need to focus.

18:20.390 --> 18:22.601
Aim in a single direction like a rocket!

18:32.528 --> 18:34.279
What?

18:39.493 --> 18:43.956
Dammit. I can't destroy this disc.

18:44.456 --> 18:47.709
It just comes back like rubber.

18:48.293 --> 18:52.965
That's why Pale Snake
told me to just collect it.

18:56.468 --> 18:57.469
Hold on!

19:01.140 --> 19:02.516
Weather Forecast,

19:02.599 --> 19:03.851
don't go any further!

19:03.934 --> 19:06.353
Can you hear me? I'm being attacked!

19:06.436 --> 19:08.188
He took my disc.

19:08.272 --> 19:10.858
If we lose him now, everything is over.

19:10.941 --> 19:12.818
Everything will end!

19:13.443 --> 19:14.736
Don't let him go!

19:15.654 --> 19:16.572
No…

19:17.114 --> 19:19.116
My voice can't reach him.

19:27.791 --> 19:29.126
What a nuisance.

19:30.085 --> 19:34.298
Jolyne Cujoh,
I thought I only needed to kill you.

19:38.468 --> 19:40.345
Jumpin' Jack Spark!

19:41.722 --> 19:45.475
Weather Forecast,
his ability takes away gravity.

19:45.559 --> 19:48.437
Do not touch whatever it is he projects.

19:48.520 --> 19:50.189
You'll become weightless!

19:51.023 --> 19:52.858
Zero gravity.

19:52.941 --> 19:55.235
So you are a Stand User yourself.

19:55.319 --> 19:57.738
Surely, you understand

19:58.322 --> 19:59.948
the implications of my ability.

20:06.622 --> 20:08.123
He projected

20:09.291 --> 20:10.834
pieces of junk.

20:12.794 --> 20:14.213
Weather Forecast.

20:14.296 --> 20:18.133
This man, who is said to
control the weather,

20:18.217 --> 20:19.843
is a mystery to me.

20:19.927 --> 20:24.181
But that cloud-like thing
must be a layer of air.

20:24.264 --> 20:27.726
He used its resistance
to deflect the enemy's attack.

20:27.809 --> 20:31.313
And he's using
centrifugal force to spin his arm.

20:31.396 --> 20:32.731
It's weightless,

20:32.814 --> 20:35.442
it can accelerate forever
with that spinning force.

20:36.026 --> 20:38.195
His body's center of gravity won't change,

20:38.278 --> 20:40.906
so he can accurately project
a powerful attack.

20:45.118 --> 20:46.620
Jumpin' Jack Spark!

20:46.703 --> 20:48.205
Weather Forecast!

20:52.292 --> 20:53.460
This flame!

20:53.961 --> 20:55.254
Aerodynamic friction?

20:55.337 --> 20:58.715
Dammit, it's spreading!

20:58.799 --> 21:00.592
Zero gravity, deactivate!

21:03.387 --> 21:04.721
Meet your end!

21:04.805 --> 21:06.431
Corridor 7B.

21:06.515 --> 21:09.393
Emergency alarm activated.

21:10.894 --> 21:13.563
Dammit. That impact…

21:13.647 --> 21:15.857
And I have the disc, too!

21:15.941 --> 21:18.527
The gate is closing.
What do I do?

21:18.610 --> 21:21.071
It's even harder
to get to the courtyard now.

21:21.571 --> 21:23.448
But I have no choice.

21:23.532 --> 21:25.033
The enemy will be trapped too!

21:25.117 --> 21:27.077
This is my chance to get back the disc!

21:35.711 --> 21:37.170
What the hell?!

21:39.089 --> 21:41.091
Everything you touch…

21:42.050 --> 21:46.596
becomes weightless… Right?

21:47.889 --> 21:49.141
Jolyne Cujoh?

22:07.826 --> 22:10.203
The courtyard is just ahead.

22:10.287 --> 22:13.123
But where did he go?

22:13.623 --> 22:15.334
I need to get the disc back!

23:41.169 --> 23:46.174
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
